  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effective Justice to Protect the Fundamental Freedoms and Privacy of People in the On-line Space</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the Action is to enhance the capacity of judiciary to protect citizens&#xBF; privacy as well as other rights and fundamental freedoms affected by the new technologies in the on-line space in line with the EU regulation and standards.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
